{"title":"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/1/55194a65eb94230d115d30cd35af8477bd3e8616.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tan 15^\\circ \\tan 25^\\circ \\tan 35^\\circ =\\tan \\theta$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"233\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/2/3429fc6d348ae7bac6cbd9729126ec3c565eaa35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0^\\circ \\le \\theta \\le 180^\\circ,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"113\" height=\"16\" /> find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/6/79607326260cf94d825a16e94c1c1b1a8af24db6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\theta.$\" width=\"12\" height=\"13\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We know from product to sum formulas we have:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/8/9d8b54c560558bb064a19b752b31e0cc1433482d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{\\sin 15^\\circ\\sin 25^\\circ\\sin 35^\\circ}{\\cos 15^\\circ\\cos 25^\\circ\\cos 35^\\circ}=\\frac{\\sin 15^{\\circ}(\\cos 10^\\circ-\\cos 60^\\circ)}{\\cos 15^\\circ(\\cos 10^\\circ+\\cos 60^\\circ)}\\]\" width=\"390\" height=\"43\" />\nMultiply by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/7/a5712881abe168b636834ad7d73f9c840efb42b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" />:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/a/05a9baab2f4c3765854c32b9fe6f3d95e9b3fb75.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{2\\sin 15^\\circ\\cos 10^\\circ-\\sin 15^\\circ}{\\cos 15^\\circ+2\\cos 15^\\circ\\cos 10^\\circ}\\]\" width=\"197\" height=\"39\" />\nAgain use product to sum:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/9/ae9e798b4be45aab4b26ada64f678a66f7430a26.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{\\sin 5^\\circ-\\sin 15^\\circ+\\sin 25^\\circ}{\\cos 5^\\circ+\\cos 15^\\circ+\\cos 25^\\circ}\\]\" width=\"195\" height=\"39\" />\nFinally, use sum to product on the rightmost terms in the numerator and denominator:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/6/fa6462667ae6ae907ec0d59bea07a99ab69377a0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{\\sin 5^{\\circ}+2\\sin 5^\\circ\\cos 20^\\circ}{\\cos 5^\\circ+2\\cos 5^\\circ\\cos 20^\\circ}=\\frac{\\sin 5^\\circ(1+2\\cos 20^\\circ)}{\\cos 5^\\circ(1+2\\cos 20^\\circ)}=\\tan 5^\\circ\\]\" width=\"432\" height=\"43\" />\nThus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/8/a58741d4682e7b16067e0d8c0a33c9d101dbb164.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\theta=\\boxed{005}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"74\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007\">Mock AIME 2 2006-2007</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems\">Problems</a></b>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?t={{{source}}}\">Source</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Prob